  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Treatment support for burn children in Mongolia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">There are a total of 9 districts in Ulaanbaatar, Mongolia. Each district treats burns at general hospitals, but most of them are sent to the burn department of the National Severe Trauma Center. In particular, Children account for the highest proportion of 70% ~80% of Burn patients. U9change will support moisturizers and burn ointments to heal burned children&apos;s scars who were admitted to the Intensive care unit and general ward of the National Severe Trauma Center in Mongolia.</narrative>
  </description>
